  "2026-08-05T20:34:59.713Z",codex-root,"Implementation scope selected after full code, PM, GitHub, official 2026.8.0 source, public docs, and live-instance orientation."
  "2026-08-05T20:53:34.696Z",codex-root,"Core 2026.8.0 is current upstream while the private live instance is 2026.7.4. Live acceptance proves manifests, setup, descriptions, readiness, and entity sources; slugify is correctly classified unavailable through unknown_command until the server upgrades."
  "2026-08-05T21:05:00.424Z",codex-root,"Post-refactor release verifier passed all ten phases: 120 test files, 1,343 tests, exact 100/100/100/100 coverage, and green build, typecheck, lint, docstrings, file size, duplication, shell, audit, PM, Trivy, history-secret, and commit gates. Remaining work is clean-tree auto-release dry-run, exact-head PR review, bot artifact disposition, merge, and PM closeout."
  "2026-08-05T21:06:23.124Z",codex-root,"Filed upstream pm-cli regression issue https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/912 after all-state duplicate search found only completed issue #688. This documents the 2026.8.5 non-atomic cross-owner seeded Plan creation behavior encountered during this delivery."
  "2026-08-05T21:10:26.060Z",codex-root,"Clean-tree auto-release dry-run passed: target v2026.8.5, prior tag v2026.8.1, pushed=false, release verifier green, and packed tarball consumers passed through both npx and bunx. Publication remains intentionally deferred to the maintainer."
