learnings[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-05T20:34:59.713Z",codex-root,"List, setup, descriptions, source, and slug contracts need bounded normalized UX; wait is a single-result readiness probe. All are read-only despite some admin-only authorization."
  "2026-08-05T20:53:37.368Z",codex-root,"integration/descriptions returns nested core/custom catalogs split into integration/helper groups, not a flat domain map; the typed CLI flattens these into deterministic source/category/domain rows and preserves translated-name metadata."
