body: "Add hassio ws integrations list|get|setup|descriptions|wait, hassio ws entity-sources, and hassio ws slugify. Normalize list-like outputs into bounded deterministic envelopes, validate domains/text/limits before network I/O, expose detailed help and schema metadata, preserve all format contracts, and retain raw ws call."
